# Sweep results and price history under data/ ARE committed - that is how
# cloud runs get their findings back to you. A blanket `data/` rule used to
# sit here, which made the workflow's `git add data/...` a silent no-op
# (the trailing `|| true` swallowed the "paths are ignored" error), so every
# scheduled run threw its results away.
data/**/*.png
data/latest_offer_count.txt
data/20*-*-*/
